{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Gallerynizer 是一款專為 iPhone 用家設計的照片圖庫清理工具，透過自動掃描找出重複項目、相似相片、模糊相片、截圖與大型影片等佔用空間的內容。應用原價 US $0.99，目前限時免費，適合想整理照片儲存空間的人使用。</p>\n\n<h2>智能整理照片儲存空間</h2>\n<p>Gallerynizer 會以檔案雜湊辨認逐位元組相同的重複照片與影片，同時將連拍、相似相片、模糊相片與截圖分類，並在裝置端分析文字，找出收據及文件。針對大型影片，它會先顯示大小估算，讓用家選擇以 HEVC 重新編碼，通常可縮小 40% 至 60%，或自動剪出精華片段；所有項目都要經用家確認，不會自動刪除。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-439-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-440-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-441-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-442-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-443-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-444-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Gallerynizer</li>\n<li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-22T17:39:17.171382+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":334,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}